+++
title = "Episode 12: The Night Shift"
[voices]
HOST = "cedar"
GUEST = { voice = "marin", style = "warm, curious" }
NARRATOR = { voice = "sage", style = "calm and low" }
+++

[section Cold open]
NARRATOR: (quietly) It was a little after two in the morning
when the lights on the third floor came back on.
[pause 800ms]
HOST: Welcome back to the show.
GUEST: (amused) Thanks for having me. It is late, though.
HOST: It is. Let's begin with the night itself.

[section The interview]
HOST: You were the only one in the building that night.
GUEST: I was. Or I thought I was, anyway.
[pause 1.5s]
GUEST: (hesitant) Then the elevator started moving on its own.
HOST: What did you do?
GUEST: I waited. [pause 600ms] And then I took the stairs.

NARRATOR: The stairwell was cold, and the door at the top
was already open.
HOST: (serious) Did you call anyone?
GUEST: Not right away. I wanted to see it for myself first.
[pause 1s]
[pause 500ms]
HOST: And what did you see?
GUEST: Nothing at all. That was the strange part.

[section Afterwards]
NARRATOR: (slowly) By morning, the lights were off again,
and the elevator stood still on the ground floor.
HOST: Thank you for telling us this.
GUEST: Thank you for listening.
HOST: (warmly) That's our show for tonight.
NARRATOR: Good night.
